sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as API caller
    participant RequestLog as RequestLogMiddleware<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Middleware/RequestLog/RequestLogMiddleware.cs
    participant AnswerFailures as AnswerFailuresMiddleware<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Middleware/AnswerFailures/AnswerFailuresMiddleware.cs
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Middleware/Authentication/AuthenticationMiddleware.cs
    participant Endpoint as ItemsHandler<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Endpoint/ItemsHandler.cs
    participant Log as LoggingMiddleware<br/>src/Middleware/Logging/LoggingMiddleware.cs
    participant Access as AccessMiddleware<br/>src/Middleware/Access/AccessMiddleware.cs
    participant Batch as BatchLimitMiddleware<br/>src/Middleware/BatchLimit/BatchLimitMiddleware.cs
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/PlanItemsHandler.cs

    Caller->>+RequestLog: POST /v1/items/plan
    RequestLog->>+AnswerFailures: the request
    AnswerFailures->>+Auth: the request
    Note over Auth: API middleware: the token to an identity in the context
    Auth->>+Endpoint: the route of the contract
    Endpoint->>+Log: PlanItems
    Log->>+Access: PlanItems
    Note over Access: command middleware: the command's mark against the identity
    Access->>+Batch: PlanItems
    Note over Batch: command middleware: the size of the batch
    Batch->>+Handler: PlanItems
    Handler-->>-Batch: the result
    Batch-->>-Access: the result
    Access-->>-Log: the result
    Log-->>-Endpoint: the result
    Endpoint-->>-Auth: 200 with JSON
    Auth-->>-AnswerFailures: the answer
    AnswerFailures-->>-RequestLog: a rejection at any step arrives here as google.rpc.Status
    RequestLog-->>-Caller: the answer
